                                "example_id": "cbd1253a-b2ad-4100-bc4a-33f3310d1655",
                                "sense_id": "ad49eaa5-8878-3b5a-97a9-bc04077e9898",
                                "text": "The report also found that kok-saghyz required a fertile soil and was especially adaptable to organic soils such as mucks and peats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8796fc37-f0fc-4997-b32b-938cb3d3491d",
                                "sense_id": "ad49eaa5-8878-3b5a-97a9-bc04077e9898",
                                "text": "Further off there is koksaghyz. Look how well the land has been cultivated. I don't know if you know — that koksaghyz is a plant imported from Russia, used to manufacture rubber."
                            }
                        ]
